[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2971873316","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107511#issuecomment-2971873316","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107511","id":2971873316,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xIzAk","user":{"login":"shadow-foss","id":144371189,"node_id":"U_kgDOCJrt9Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144371189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss","html_url":"https://github.com/shadow-foss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-13T22:30:53Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T22:31:31Z","body":"Quick question: the toggle is enabled by default, so keys/markers go to the timeline cursor.\r\nPreviously, they were added at the mouse position by default.\r\nCould this change be confusing?\r\nShould I set the default to disabled for consistency?\r\n\r\nHappy to change it if needed!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2971873316/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972054442","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107511#issuecomment-2972054442","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107511","id":2972054442,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xJfOq","user":{"login":"SanNull","id":124409014,"node_id":"U_kgDOB2pUtg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124409014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull","html_url":"https://github.com/SanNull","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-14T00:52:52Z","updated_at":"2025-06-14T00:52:52Z","body":"Imo I think this should be an opt in, so disabled by default","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972054442/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972269759","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107511#issuecomment-2972269759","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107511","id":2972269759,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xKTy_","user":{"login":"shadow-foss","id":144371189,"node_id":"U_kgDOCJrt9Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144371189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss","html_url":"https://github.com/shadow-foss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-14T05:06:38Z","updated_at":"2025-06-14T05:06:38Z","body":"Just pushed a small update: changed the default to false for compatibility with the previous behavior (inserting at mouse position).\r\nAlso open to renaming the setting,other variables if there's a better consensus on the wording :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972269759/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2974389777","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107511#issuecomment-2974389777","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107511","id":2974389777,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xSZYR","user":{"login":"shadow-foss","id":144371189,"node_id":"U_kgDOCJrt9Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144371189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss","html_url":"https://github.com/shadow-foss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-15T17:54:34Z","updated_at":"2025-06-15T18:36:47Z","body":"Just discovered a bug when insert_at_current_time is enabled, inserting multiple keys quickly results in insertion of multiple keys away from current time. This doesn't happen with markers.\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/21b05f90-9da1-4ea6-9d38-db79721a303c\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCause:\r\nIn animation_track_editor.cpp, inside _insert_key_from_track(), the key insertion offset logic always runs:\r\n```cpp\r\nwhile (animation->track_find_key(p_track, p_ofs, Animation::FIND_MODE_APPROX) != -1) {\r\n\tp_ofs += SECOND_DECIMAL;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nFix:\r\nSkip the offset adjustment when the toggle is enabled:\r\n```cpp\r\nwhile (animation->track_find_key(p_track, p_ofs, Animation::FIND_MODE_APPROX) != -1 && !is_insert_at_current_time_enabled()) {\r\n\tp_ofs += SECOND_DECIMAL;\r\n}\r\n```\r\nI'll include this fix along with the other changes. Let me know if it looks okay!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2974389777/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2974485803","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107511#issuecomment-2974485803","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107511","id":2974485803,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xSw0r","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-15T18:18:32Z","updated_at":"2025-06-15T18:18:32Z","body":"I think it would be nice if it also affected duplicate operation. I remember the AnimationPlayer used to insert duplicated keys at current time, but it was changed at some point.\r\n\r\nI also noticed the toolbar in animation player has became quite crowded 🤔 \r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c1daa887-5758-4f79-83f1-91dcda608bb5)\r\nAnd this adds yet another button.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2974485803/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2974737088","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107511#issuecomment-2974737088","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107511","id":2974737088,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xTuLA","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-15T22:59:31Z","updated_at":"2025-06-15T23:00:53Z","body":"> Skip the offset adjustment when the toggle is enabled:\r\n\r\nSome operations (such as baking) require keys to be inserted, but I assume this was a hack to prevent the index from being corrupted due to overwriting (deletion).\r\n\r\nIn the case of markers, the current skip operation is okay, but in the case of keys, it will be necessary to test whether there are any problems in some operations.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2974737088/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2977049299","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107511#issuecomment-2977049299","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107511","id":2977049299,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xcirT","user":{"login":"shadow-foss","id":144371189,"node_id":"U_kgDOCJrt9Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144371189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss","html_url":"https://github.com/shadow-foss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T15:14:37Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T15:14:37Z","body":"> Some operations (such as baking) require keys to be inserted, but I assume this was a hack to prevent the index from being corrupted due to overwriting (deletion).\r\n\r\nWhat do you think about skipping key insertion at the current time if a key already exists and `insert_at_current_time` is enabled?\r\nInstead of overwriting, we’d just skip insertion and display a warning like:\r\n`A key already exists at the current time. Insertion skipped.`\r\nor is it fine to have the default behaviour where new key gets inserted to nearby position.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2977049299/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2977620973","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107511#issuecomment-2977620973","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107511","id":2977620973,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xeuPt","user":{"login":"shadow-foss","id":144371189,"node_id":"U_kgDOCJrt9Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144371189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss","html_url":"https://github.com/shadow-foss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T18:25:19Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T18:25:19Z","body":">I think it would be nice if it also affected duplicate operation. I remember the AnimationPlayer used to insert duplicated keys at current time, but it was changed at some point.\r\n\r\nCurrently, AnimationPlayer still pastes or duplicates keys at the timeline cursor when using keyboard shortcuts. However, when using the menu, keys are inserted at the mouse position. I tried to make the toggle affect paste/duplicate as well, but both functions currently overwrite existing keys without any checks, which could lead to unintended behavior—as @TokageItLab pointed out.\r\nI'll add support for the toggle to paste and duplicate once I figure out a proper way to handle overwriting of existing keys.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2977620973/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2978512340","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107511#issuecomment-2978512340","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107511","id":2978512340,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xiH3U","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T00:02:42Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T00:10:11Z","body":"Existing keys should be always overwritten with the latest pasted/inserted keys.\r\n\r\nHowever, in cases where multiple keys are selected and processed sequentially, care must be taken not to break the indices. At this point, we also need to be careful about the Undo operation.\r\n\r\nI think the fundamental problem is that the same method is used for inserts from both external operation and internal sources.\r\n\r\nIdeally, it would be great to be able to fix to override always take into account sequence and undo, but that might be a big change to include in this PR. For now, I think you can leave it as the default behavior and then raise an issue saying “keys cannot be inserted in the same position” and fix it in a separate PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2978512340/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2979281460","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107511#issuecomment-2979281460","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107511","id":2979281460,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xlDo0","user":{"login":"shadow-foss","id":144371189,"node_id":"U_kgDOCJrt9Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144371189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss","html_url":"https://github.com/shadow-foss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T07:39:36Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T07:39:36Z","body":"I tested pasting and duplicating keys at the same position multiple times. They currently overwrite existing keys as expected, and undo/redo works correctly.\r\nSince this PR doesn't change that logic, and insert still avoids collisions via offset adjustment, I think it's safe to leave as-is.\r\nHowever, for long-term consistency and clarity, I’d be happy to open a follow-up issue discussing whether paste/duplicate should also warn or prevent overwrites like insert does.\r\nAlso wanted to share my changes here before pushing it.\r\n\r\nmade the toggle button affect paste and duplicate operations:\r\n```diff\r\n-           emit_signal(SNAME(\"duplicate_request\"), insert_at_pos, true);\r\n+          emit_signal(SNAME(\"duplicate_request\"), insert_at_pos, !editor->is_insert_at_current_time_enabled());\r\n-           emit_signal(SNAME(\"paste_request\"), insert_at_pos, true);\r\n+          emit_signal(SNAME(\"paste_request\"), insert_at_pos, !editor->is_insert_at_current_time_enabled());\r\n```\r\nchanged the function resolve_insertion_offset() to use reference passing and changed function call accord to it:\r\n```diff\r\n-float AnimationTrackEditor::get_insert_at_current_time_position_if_enabled(float p_fallback_ofs) const {\r\n+void AnimationTrackEditor::resolve_insertion_offset(float &r_offset) const {\r\n        if (is_insert_at_current_time_enabled()) {\r\n-               return timeline->get_play_position();\r\n-       } else {\r\n-               return p_fallback_ofs;\r\n+               r_offset = timeline->get_play_position();\r\n        }\r\n }\r\n```\r\nLet me know if this looks good or if anything should be tweaked before I push it.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2979281460/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":